# 2. PRODUCT VISION

CareBridge AI is an AI-powered post-treatment patient monitoring and care coordination platform.

It connects:

- Hospitals
- Private clinics
- Treating doctors
- Territorial family doctors
- Patients
- Authorized family caregivers

The core problem:

After patients leave hospitals or complete medical procedures, their treatment-related monitoring may become fragmented.

Doctors may not receive structured updates about patient-reported symptoms, medication confirmations, or follow-up needs.

Patients may forget medications, miss follow-up appointments, or struggle to communicate changes in their condition.

CareBridge AI creates a structured monitoring workflow after treatment.

## MAIN OBJECTIVE

Make post-treatment patient follow-up organized, accessible, documented, and easier for healthcare professionals to manage.

## FIVE CORE PRODUCT CAPABILITIES

1. Automatic post-discharge doctor assignment and follow-up tracking.
2. Medication scheduling, SMS reminders and intake confirmation tracking.
3. Daily patient health check-ins and symptom reporting.
4. Optional AI voice follow-up and intelligent patient communication.
5. Doctor dashboards with patient histories, AI summaries, trends and follow-up management.

## IMPORTANT CLINICAL POSITIONING

CareBridge AI is a healthcare workflow-support product, NOT an autonomous medical decision-maker.

It does not diagnose illnesses, prescribe medications, determine that a patient is recovering, or replace a licensed doctor.

Every clinical decision remains with qualified medical professionals.

